  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide access to adapted seeds and inputs (drought tolerant, short cycle), through practice of climate-smart agricultural techniques with an emphasis on water and soil management, conserve and manage harvests with improved post-harvest processing techniques, for households to increase their agricultural production and improve household food security.</narrative>
